  "notes": "Source data combines Division A (Table V-4) and Division B (Table V-8) via derive sum to form the Combined population (matching Table V-12). Target rows 50-54 and 90+ have no direct source bins; 50-54 is approximated by splitting the '51-55' bin (share_even) as it is the closest available lower bound, and 90+ rows are empty as the source '86+' bin does not extend to 90. The 'Number' column is the sum of counts from both divisions. The 'AverageBenefit' is derived as the ratio of summed Total Benefits to summed Number. No monthly conversion needed as values are annual.",
